very last game.

4
00:00:02,392 --> 00:00:03,483
Back in 2006,

5
00:00:03,483 --> 00:00:04,412
Zinedine Zidane had

6
00:00:04,412 --> 00:00:05,700
already announced that the World

7
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:06,641
Cup would be the last

8
00:00:06,641 --> 00:00:07,628
tournament of his career.

9
00:00:07,628 --> 00:00:08,150
And France made

10
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:08,591
it all the way

11
00:00:08,591 --> 00:00:09,207
to the final

12
00:00:09,207 --> 00:00:10,472
against Italy, in Berlin.

13
00:00:10,472 --> 00:00:11,308
After seven minutes,

14
00:00:11,308 --> 00:00:12,156
Zidane stepped up

15
00:00:12,156 --> 00:00:12,817
