23
00:00:18,669 --> 00:00:19,690
and France were winning.

24
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:20,457
Twelve minutes later,

25
00:00:20,457 --> 00:00:21,536
Marco Materazzi headed

26
00:00:21,536 --> 00:00:22,337
in the equalizer.

27
00:00:22,337 --> 00:00:22,767
The game went

28
00:00:22,767 --> 00:00:23,498
