42
00:00:34,876 --> 00:00:35,283
But the fourth

43
00:00:35,283 --> 00:00:35,875
official had.

44
00:00:35,875 --> 00:00:36,478
Through the referee's

45
00:00:36,478 --> 00:00:37,303
headset, he said:

46
00:00:37,303 --> 00:00:38,789
Horacio, Horacio, I

47
00:00:38,789 --> 00:00:39,219
saw it.

48
00:00:39,219 --> 00:00:40,101
And Zidane was shown

49
00:00:40,101 --> 00:00:40,937
a red card.

50
00:00:40,937 --> 00:00:41,680
So one of the greatest

51
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:42,354
players of all

52
00:00:42,354 --> 00:00:43,456
time walked off the pitch

53
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:44,049
for the last

54
00:00:44,049 --> 00:00:44,838
time, right past

55
00:00:44,838 --> 00:00:45,732
the World Cup trophy.

56
00:00:45,732 --> 00:00:46,405
And without him,

57
00:00:46,405 --> 00:00:47,334
France lost the shootout

58
00:00:47,334 --> 00:00:47,926
5-3.

59
00:00:47,926 --> 00:00:49,447
Italy were world champions.

60
00:00:49,447 --> 00:00:50,271
But here's the wild

61
00:00:50,271 --> 00:00:50,585
part.

62
00:00:50,585 --> 00:00:51,142
The next morning,

63
00:00:51,142 --> 00:00:52,187
FIFA announced the best

64
00:00:52,187 --> 00:00:52,977
player of the whole

65
00:00:52,977 --> 00:00:53,395
tournament.

66
00:00:53,395 --> 00:00:54,068
Most of the journalists

67
00:00:54,068 --> 00:00:54,660
